id: pm-frbf0j
title: Accept encoding format aliases on core item collections and mutations
description: "Deliver the remaining GH-1480 format alias on item collection and lifecycle paths using SDK-owned contracts, preserving native formats, package flag ownership, and refusal write safety."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:cli",fix
