comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T08:41:03.221Z","harness:codex","Focused implementation child of the existing uniform-output programme for GH-1480, not a second defect owner. Duplicate check: complete strict 2993-item all-status corpus, parent full metadata and raw history, previous canonical-encoding child pm-1rta7z, request-specific search, and live open/in-progress lists. Previous child delivered --output-format, this child delivers the remaining --format compatibility spelling."
  "2026-10-18T08:43:02.948Z","harness:codex","Focused initial acceptance: 22 sandbox tests passed across both encoding spellings, prefix/suffix and inline forms, collection/mutation lifecycles, namespace routing, domain formats, and byte-identical refusal preservation. Complete parent raw histories read with limit 10000: pm-srns 93 events and pm-wg07 44 events, no omissions. Runtime discovery now also exposes the conditional alias, with package commands retaining their own vocabulary. Full gates pending."
  "2026-10-18T08:48:53.004Z","harness:codex","Live operational baseline: published 2026.10.18 verifier passed registry/GitHub Release and npx/bunx CLI plus MCP stateless/Skills/Apps journeys. Required 14-day Sentry gate reports 0 unresolved issues, 0 critical/high; telemetry error rate 2.59%, 0 missing failure codes, current-minute data; physical queue empty at inspection. All three GitHub open-security inventories are empty and all 25 open issues have PM links. Dependency current=wanted: newer compatible releases are younger than 7 days (marked 18.1.1 Oct12 12:29Z, typescript-eslint 8.71.2 Oct12 17:10Z, gpt-tokenizer 4.0.3 Oct15 01:15Z, eslint 10.13 Oct16 14:24Z; Unicorn78 Oct12 19:03Z). Existing major-upgrade owners pm-t3jxjj/pm-fokyhh/pm-do5b/pm-ksr40d were refreshed live. No cooldown exception is justified."
  "2026-10-18T09:00:38.847Z","harness:codex","Validation coordination: the initial full-source coverage consumer holds the checkout build lease. Parallel package dogfood reached its linked-test deadline while waiting for that lease, so it is not compatibility failure evidence and will be rerun serially. Full coverage also revealed a genuine internal-worker contract regression from exposing an encoding alias on an empty flag table; retain the failure and correct it before closeout. Do not weaken worker visibility, test timeouts, coverage denominator, or lease safety."
  "2026-10-18T09:23:10.795Z","harness:codex","PM-linked verification passed (18121 ms) with local_source_ref trust; the guidance child linked verification also passed (28169 ms). Isolated corrected reruns passed 82 tests, including the 117-refusal gate negative control, graph-replication scope, governance latency, workspace contract rows, internal worker namespace behavior, and npm-backed packed continuation. The local Homebrew npm module root is exposed via NODE_PATH for that existing fixture requirement, without repository toolchain changes. Full-source capped-worker coverage and final static gate are still pending, so no closure or full-coverage claim yet."
  "2026-10-18T09:51:26.826Z","harness:codex","Full corrected-source verification passed in an isolated checkout with byte-identical changed source/docs/tests: 826 test files passed, one platform file skipped; 10662 tests passed, three platform tests skipped, 10665 total. Exact full-source coverage: statements 69359/69359, branches 53294/53294, functions 14281/14281, lines 65834/65834 (100/100/100/100, zero uncovered). NODE_PATH exposed the existing Homebrew npm module and --maxWorkers=2 retained all cases and thresholds. Package-first dogfood and npx/bunx packed smoke passed for all nine bundled packages. Latest pm-changelog 2026.10.17 baseline check and deep package doctor passed; strict PM resolution/history validation passed. The prior 82-test count refers only to the final four-file isolated rerun; worker and packed-continuation behavior were also proven in the preceding targeted run. Static content/contract/assurance prefix passed; import timing is being rerun serially after coverage completed."
  "2026-10-18T09:57:45.001Z","harness:codex","Final local gates are green with unchanged source and ceilings: the full static prefix passed security/dependency, runtime lock, docstrings, dead exports, ESLint/duplication, workflow permissions/cooldown, generated contracts/docs, package boundary/parity, replication, grammar, flag invocation/lexicon, refusal closure, agent-task tokens, tracker context, registry and public SDK surface. Serial SDK import benchmark passed all 10 entrypoints; unchanged CLI transport rerun passed all six operations after a single 2 ms miss; graph composition and record integrity passed after six existing prose citations were bound to typed related context; bounded mutation gate passed. Full-source exact 100/100/100/100 and packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx proof remain applicable. Fresh Sentry pm.command span detail was verified for an opt-in real get action; telemetry flush succeeded and required issue/error-code gate passed. All scope is ready for reviewed delivery."
